  "I4" [label="(0,0,0) abduction: Given [currently, DMDs are typically used as reflective binary amplitude modulators in TVAM/light-based printers] and [currently, the work presents a hologram pipeline ... Lee holograms enable using a DMD as a fast phase modulator], therefore [a DMD driven with Lee holograms is a plausible fast hardware path to implement phase-encoded holographic projections for TVAM]."];
